From 39447f69454948d4fa347e356396875c8d72a9b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthon Gretter <anthon.gretter@bry.com.br>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 17:37:39 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] locker: animated Fresh wave lock screen background

Render Fresh's wave screensaver (tide physics from fresh-editor's
WaveEffect) live as the lock screen background, ~30 fps. The tide
rises on every lock, then loops seamlessly. Falls back to the
configured wallpaper if no font can be loaded.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
